 that's made locally here in New Orleans. Also, it's worth upgrading from the free tasting. You get to try more flavors and you can keep the glass!"},{"business_id":"psVf3ImVOo44xBeh-oVEcg","review_id":"oq-5emREbUJ-KALk3wWHdg","date":"2011-06-09T16:30:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9382320046424866,"text_excerpt":"I was excited about the fact that many of the wines here are from LA because I am fully for supporting local businesses. Even though the wines aren't \"real\" (with grapes) as other commenters have mentioned, they have alcohol in them, so I don't really see the problem there. I'll take the good taste and feel good without the headache the next day! I really enjoyed coming here because the staff was friendly, knowledgeable, and thankful, and they let us taste as many wines as we wanted."},{"business_id":"psVf3ImVOo44xBeh-oVEcg","review_id":"VSROfkGem1RCgLRAfxGugA","date":"2011-08-13T05:42:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9217395782470703,"text_excerpt":"I loveeeee dessert wine so when I stumpled upon this place, I was a kid in a candy store! Except there are no candies but the sweets are provided in alcoholic form...hangover optional. The lady was very nice and they have free wine tasting all day. I tasted about 6 different tropical wines and they were great! Now comes the million dollar question, which one to buy? *biting nails* We ended up with a bottle of \"White Gold\" which tasted similar to Moscato. My boyfriend and I enjoyed our wine with some cheese in our hotel room cuz we fancy like that. A relaxing and somewhat romantic night in NOLA for our mini vacation :)"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"psVf3ImVOo44xBeh-oVEcg","photo_id":"ktAGaFld7y7_or5AanSeIg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/ktAGaFld7y7_or5AanSeIg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9510706067085266},{"business_id":"psVf3ImVOo44xBeh-oVEcg","photo_id":"-6VRnpuOJAjyfdLhuJJ7Vw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-6VRnpuOJAjyfdLhuJJ7Vw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.896201491355896},{"business_id":"psVf3ImVOo44xBeh-oVEcg","photo_id":"mNVazRWmA0HPyOevX6ORBA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mNVazRWmA0HPyOevX6ORBA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8512797355651855}]},"notebook_case":null}
